<div id="2026-11-16-shared-photo-reader" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-11-16 — One shared photo and barcode reader for items and supplier invoices (Android app, web, Chat with AI)</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>One code path.</strong> The Android app, the web inventory pages and Chat with AI all run the same server code: <code>Comserv::Util::Inventory::PhotoRead</code> behind <code>/api/app/photo/*</code>. Chat reaches the same subs through <code>Model::AI2::PhotoIntent</code> (called from <code>AI2::chat</code>); the web views (<code>/static/js/ai-chat/feature-photo.js</code>, used by the chat cards, the <code>/Inventory/invoice</code> "Read a photo or scan a barcode" panel and the admin <code>/Inventory/photo_reads</code> page) only draw results and post what the person chose. Stock moves go through <code>Comserv::Util::Inventory::StockTxn</code>, moved out of <code>/Inventory/api/transaction</code> so both use one writer. The vision engine of the consignment count moved to <code>Comserv::Util::VisionRead</code> (the count inherits it unchanged).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Flow.</strong> A photo is read in the background into an editable transcription (<code>raw_text</code>) plus lines; a failed read keeps its text so it can be corrected and re-parsed with a text-only AI call (no vision call), falling back to a plain-text parser. Every line is checked against inventory (SKU, supplier SKU, name, unique partial name) and shows qty and unit price for the person to edit. Invoices show subtotal, tax, shipping, total beside the sum of the lines with a mismatch warning. The supplier is matched, picked from the top 5 candidates, or created on confirm from the details read off the invoice (<code>InvoiceCreate::_auto_create_supplier</code> with its web lookup). Confirm creates the chosen items (<code>_create_chat_item</code>), attaches the read photo to an item (<code>ItemImage->save</code>, downscaled), and writes a DRAFT invoice with its totals (<code>MailInvoiceStock::draft_invoice</code>, the mail reader's draft half). Nothing receives stock or posts GL there. A barcode or description finds the item (<code>InventoryBarcode->by_barcode</code> / the same name matcher) and offers receive, count, use or move; a move writes two <code>transfer</code> rows, a count a signed <code>count_adjust</code>, no GL, no picture stored. Invoice photos are only a debug backup: deleted after confirm unless kept, re-runnable and deletable from the admin list; item photos are removed after confirm. Plain chat images are now read by VisionRead and the text goes into the chat prompt (signed-in users only; guest limits unchanged).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Endpoints</strong> (session gate <code>_api_inventory_session_gate</code>): <code>POST /api/app/photo/read</code> (202), <code>GET /api/app/photo/read/&lt;id&gt;</code>, <code>POST /api/app/photo/reparse</code>, <code>POST /api/app/photo/confirm</code>, <code>POST /api/app/photo/rerun</code> (202), <code>POST /api/app/photo/delete</code>, <code>GET /api/app/photo/reads</code> (admin), <code>POST /api/app/photo/scan</code>, <code>POST /api/app/photo/scan/apply</code>. The Android app should switch InvoicePhotoScreen, ItemPhotoScreen and its scan screen to these routes and drop its own /ai2/chat prompt and phone-side parser.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Also fixed.</strong> The <code>'3d'</code> site fallbacks in <code>ConsignmentCountRun</code>/<code>ConsignmentCountApply</code> now use the placement/count site, then the request site. <code>/Inventory/api/transaction</code> passed a <code>gl_entry_id</code> column that <code>inventory_transactions</code> does not have in its Result class; StockTxn only sends it when the column exists.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> New: <code>lib/Comserv/Util/VisionRead.pm</code>, <code>lib/Comserv/Util/Inventory/PhotoRead.pm</code>, <code>lib/Comserv/Util/Inventory/StockTxn.pm</code>, <code>lib/Comserv/Model/AI2/PhotoIntent.pm</code>, <code>root/static/js/ai-chat/feature-photo.js</code>, <code>root/Inventory/invoice/photo_read.tt</code>, <code>root/Inventory/photo_reads.tt</code>, <code>t/inventory_photo_read.t</code>. Changed: <code>ConsignmentCountVision.pm</code>, <code>ConsignmentCountRun.pm</code>, <code>ConsignmentCountApply.pm</code>, <code>Inventory/MailInvoiceStock.pm</code>, <code>Model/AI2/InvoiceCreate.pm</code>, <code>Controller/Api.pm</code>, <code>Controller/AI2.pm</code>, <code>Controller/Inventory.pm</code>, <code>root/static/js/local-chat.js</code>, <code>root/js_load.tt</code>, <code>root/Inventory/invoice/list.tt</code>, <code>.gitignore</code>. No schema change.</p>
</div>
